# Observability

- Trace = one job (one unit of work). Spans = graph nodes. Generations = individual LLM
  calls, each carrying model, tokens, cost, and prompt version.
- Every log line is JSON and carries the Langfuse `trace_id`, so any log line can be joined
  back to its trace.
- **Never logged, ever:** credentials, raw PII, full media payloads, row-level query
  results. Log references (ids, URLs, content hashes) instead of the content itself.
- Every error response carries a stable error code plus the `trace_id`, specifically so a
  support conversation can open the exact trace immediately — don't return an error without
  one just because the failure feels minor.
